message: "If you used Amyloid Modifier and would like to cite it, please use the reference below for the version you used. Citations are appreciated, but not expected."
type: software
title: "Amyloid Modifier for ChimeraX"
authors:
  - family-names: Ou
    given-names: Songxian
version: "2.4.1"
date-released: 2026-11-13
url: "https://cxtoolshed.rbvi.ucsf.edu/apps/chimeraxamyloidmodifier"
repository-code: "https://github.com/songxou0909/AmyloidModifier"
license: MIT
abstract: "Amyloid Modifier is a ChimeraX add-on that streamlines routine preparation and editing of multilayer amyloid fibril models. It provides a graphical interface for identifying layers and protofilaments, trimming and expanding fibril models, renaming chains, invoking secondary-structure reassignment, and generating ISOLDE torsion-restraint command files."
keywords:
  - ChimeraX
  - amyloid
  - structural biology
  - cryo-EM
  - molecular modeling
